- 不得改變：source/cursor/Y-domain、marker/accounting/download、document/data revisions、one-in-flight action、provider authority、4000 visible cap與WebSharper-only F# frontend。
- 範圍：Dynamic Renderer、必要時Interactive.Client generic frame/application scheduling、BrowserDemo／F# Playwright long-task fixture、RFC/current docs、exact packages；不修改FSSTL、MDCQ或Daedalus consumer domain types。
